unist states and does not cover Holocaust-era takings.","The plaintiffs argue the statute covers property rights taken in violation of international law."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 28, lines 21-29","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/19-351_d0fi.pdf","page_label":"file page 28, lines 21-29"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 23-19","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/19-351_d0fi.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 23-19"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 49, lines 55-49","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/19-351_d0fi.pdf","page_label":"file page 49, lines 55-49"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 66, lines 31-45","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/19-351_d0fi.pdf","page_label":"file page 66, lines 31-45"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 86, lines 49-53","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/19-351_d0fi.pdf","page_label":"file page 86, lines 49-53"}]},{"heading":"What the justices asked","paragraphs":["Chief Justice Roberts asked if stripping citizenship before the taking changes the legal analysis.","Justice Breyer asked how a similar plaintiff recovered in a prior case."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 39-55","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2020/19-351_d0fi.pdf","page_label":"file page 10, lines 39-55"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 11, lines 27-41","official_u